      "start_seconds": 34.75,
      "end_seconds": 44.29,
      "duration_seconds": 9.54,
      "text": "I see go ahead. Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is what the the pattern is what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.9,
      "end_seconds": 61.81,
      "duration_seconds": 15.91,
      "text": "I'd call it mild. Only going outside, and it's not much. I notice it more with at home. I did have nausea at one point, but that's gone now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 62.64,
      "end_seconds": 69.16,
      "duration_seconds": 6.52,
      "text": "have you had headaches in the evenings at home before or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.24,
      "end_seconds": 76.1,
      "duration_seconds": 5.86,
      "text": "I had a similar thing about six months ago it went away"
    },
