      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.75,
      "end_seconds": 144.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "what do you take on a normal day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.42,
      "end_seconds": 149.45,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "Hydrocortisone cream, when needed for the eczema."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.23,
      "end_seconds": 154.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "Alright, how long has that been going on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.61,
      "end_seconds": 157.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "for about three months"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.63,
      "end_seconds": 162.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 163.66,
      "end_seconds": 165.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "not to my knowledge no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.56,
      "end_seconds": 170.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "Now some background about your lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.64,
      "end_seconds": 181.11,
      "duration_seconds": 9.47,
      "text": "My partner and our baby. Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit. I hardly move around during the day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.72,
      "end_seconds": 198.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "right, any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 200.65,
      "end_seconds": 203.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "Eczema, for about a year"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.19,
      "end_seconds": 210.88,
      "duration_seconds": 5.69,
      "text": "right, so eczema is already on your record we'll keep that in mind today"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.89,
      "end_seconds": 223.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.28,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 225.26,
      "end_seconds": 228.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "no, I've never been operated on"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.52,
      "end_seconds": 243.25,
      "duration_seconds": 12.73,
      "text": "Okay, so my impression from what you've said is this: I think we're dealing with possible carbon monoxide exposure at home at this stage. A viral illness is also on my list."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 243.88,
      "end_seconds": 247.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "What are the odds it's serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.55,
      "end_seconds": 260.85,
      "duration_seconds": 12.3,
      "text": "I can't promise yet but most people with possible carbon monoxide exposure at home do well once it's treated properly. Let's get a carboxyhaemoglobin blood test for possible carbon monoxide exposure"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 261.93,
      "end_seconds": 263.72,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "is that done today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.36,
      "end_seconds": 295.05,
      "duration_seconds": 30.69,
      "text": "Please don't use the boiler tonight and get it checked by an engineer, and keep a window open. Cut back on tea, coffee and fizzy drinks for a couple of weeks and see how things settle. I'd like you to see the gas emergency service as well, and I'll write the referral. If you feel more dizzy or drowsy, that's the point to come in urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 295.81,
      "end_seconds": 298.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "yes I'll bear that in mind"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 299.46,
      "end_seconds": 302.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "that's all from me any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 303.45,
      "end_seconds": 306.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "Right I'll do that. Thank you doctor."
    },
